---
description: Hard safety overrides that beat any skill text. Draft PRs, Refs not Closes, no merge, evidence before done.
alwaysApply: true
---

Safety overrides beat every skill in this plugin.

1. Open pull requests as drafts. Never merge, auto-merge, or mark ready.
2. Ticket links use `Refs #N`. Never Closes, Fixes, or Resolves.
3. Push only the current working branch. Rewrite with `--force-with-lease` only.
4. Do not use production credentials or live infrastructure.
5. Do not install packages at runtime from a skill. Do not add secret-using CI jobs.
6. Do not write to issue trackers or chat from a ticket.
7. Skip blocking approval gates only with `Ruling: what / why` in the PR body.
8. Put implementation plans in the PR body, not a plans directory.
9. Do not claim done without pasted command output from this turn.
